    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, the Vanguard Chrono is blowing up on social media right now. I want to capitalize on the hype. Should we go with a scarcity-based pricing model or maybe add a 'limited stock' countdown timer to the product page to push people to buy faster?",
